Save Your Soul Incorporated is a building on the [[Geography/Black and White/Plaza|plaza]] in the [[Geography/Black and White/index|Black and White]], its roof fallen in and its door blocked, with three speakers on poles in front. It is the way onward from the plaza. Three caught sounds poured into the three speakers clear the fallen roof and open the entrance.

Inside are shades at a reception desk and an elevator at the end of a hallway. The elevator's buttons are engraved with line-art symbols in place of floor numbers, among them the three wavy lines of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]], three dots in a triangle in the shape of [[Aut]]'s mark, a polyhedron, and a telescope. Only the three-dot button lights when pressed, and it carries the rider up into an endless white void of rolling fog, where Aut floats on his back with his hands behind his head.

The way back is a concrete wall bearing a black stone threshold in the shape of a door. Three knocks on it return the traveler to the [[Pharos]].
